# Airbender Ascension: "exile up to one target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's
# control". A token that is exiled ceases to exist and does not return (CR 111.7), so flickering a Spirit token just removes
# it. Two Ornithopters (turn 1) and Lingering Souls' two Spirit tokens (turn 3) make four quest counters; at the turn 3 end
# step Bot1 targets a Spirit. One Spirit is left, nothing is in exile, and since no creature entered again the enchantment
# still has four counters (a returned creature would make five).

